
SFTSCAN - the scan KRNL386 does, where it can be read
looking for the console name, three with equal gaps

names found: 0005
  at 00000802
  at 0000083D  gap 0000003B
  at 00000878  gap 0000003B
  at 00000F9A  gap 00000722
  at 000040E4  gap 0000314A

a scanner would call an entry 0000003B bytes, table at 00000802
BUT SFT_LEN IS 30h - it would measure the wrong thing.

real-mode vectors after the park:
  INT 11h  -> F000:CB20
  INT 12h  -> F000:CB40
  INT 15h  -> F000:CBA0
  INT 1Ah  -> F000:CBE0

SFTSCAN done
